WEBVTT

00:03:23.340 --> 00:03:24.040
Impossible...

00:03:27.210 --> 00:03:28.540
So simply...

00:03:31.780 --> 00:03:33.040
All too easily...!

00:03:35.720 --> 00:03:40.560
Hmmm... I suppose the lives of most
of us end pretty much like that.

00:03:44.230 --> 00:03:48.790
We die, without so much as a goodbye...

00:03:48.930 --> 00:03:51.490
Geez, such a desolate feeling, isn't it?

00:04:18.960 --> 00:04:20.020
Bastard...

00:04:20.730 --> 00:04:22.790
What did you say just now...?

00:04:22.930 --> 00:04:25.200
I dare you to say it again!

00:04:26.600 --> 00:04:32.370
Oh, it seems crybaby Polnareff
is trying to talk tough now.

00:04:32.840 --> 00:04:33.670
Polnareff!

00:04:33.810 --> 00:04:35.340
Don't let him provoke you!

00:04:35.480 --> 00:04:36.450
Don't you understand?

00:04:36.910 --> 00:04:40.110
Avdol-san warned you about
the danger of fighting alone!

00:04:40.620 --> 00:04:42.550
But you ignored that.

00:04:42.690 --> 00:04:46.120
And now, you're trying to take
revenge, even if it kills you both!

00:04:48.390 --> 00:04:49.190
Then...

00:04:50.290 --> 00:04:52.130
what am I supposed to do?

00:04:52.500 --> 00:04:54.120
Unless there's a chance of winning...

00:04:54.270 --> 00:04:55.530
you must not fight!

00:04:55.670 --> 00:04:56.500
At the moment...

00:04:56.630 --> 00:04:59.100
we don't quite understand
the nature of their Stands...

00:04:59.240 --> 00:05:00.600
so just retreat for now!

00:05:02.440 --> 00:05:05.240
Avdol was cowardly stabbed from behind.

00:05:05.980 --> 00:05:08.100
Are you telling me to bear
this humiliation and run!?

00:05:08.250 --> 00:05:10.610
Don't fight a battle that
may cost you your life!

00:05:10.750 --> 00:05:13.240
That's what Avdol-san
was trying to tell you!

00:05:20.020 --> 00:05:22.580
What's all that jabbering about, you two?

00:05:22.730 --> 00:05:25.420
I'm ready when you are...

00:05:25.560 --> 00:05:28.760
Okay, Pol-Pol m'boy?

00:05:30.400 --> 00:05:31.060
Polnareff!

00:05:31.800 --> 00:05:34.130
Don't waste Avdol-san's...

00:05:34.270 --> 00:05:35.070
DEATH!

00:05:49.890 --> 00:05:51.010
Damn it!

00:05:52.590 --> 00:05:53.560
Alright...

00:06:01.070 --> 00:06:01.930
I'm sorry...

00:06:02.400 --> 00:06:09.730
Polnareff...

00:06:17.050 --> 00:06:20.250
That guy Avdol died for you...

00:06:20.380 --> 00:06:25.150
I guess you owe him one now. He wouldn't
have died if you weren't here, right?

00:06:27.890 --> 00:06:28.550
Bastard!

00:06:29.160 --> 00:06:30.650
Where's his main body!?

00:06:31.060 --> 00:06:31.930
Polnareff!

00:06:32.200 --> 00:06:32.890
Calm down!

00:06:35.270 --> 00:06:38.960
But... there's no need to be sad, Polnareff.

00:06:39.100 --> 00:06:41.400
You will meet Avdol soon...

00:06:42.140 --> 00:06:45.580
and your precious little sister as well, eh?

00:06:46.310 --> 00:06:47.240
What!?

00:06:48.210 --> 00:06:51.410
When you meet your little sister again...

00:06:51.550 --> 00:06:55.380
why don't you ask her
about how I killed her...?

00:07:07.600 --> 00:07:09.120
Don't take the bait!

00:07:09.270 --> 00:07:11.000
He's trying to provoke you!

00:07:13.000 --> 00:07:14.830
Baaassstaard!

00:07:27.520 --> 00:07:32.320
It's impossible for your Chariot
to cut my Hanged Man.

00:07:32.460 --> 00:07:36.090
I exist inside the mirror...

00:07:36.560 --> 00:07:41.020
and your Stand is unable to come inside!

00:07:41.170 --> 00:07:42.630
Are you frustrated...?

00:07:42.770 --> 00:07:45.330
I'm sure you're frustrated.

00:07:46.570 --> 00:07:48.470
Hey, Hol Horse, shoot him!

00:07:49.040 --> 00:07:51.800
Let's finish off this idiot...

00:07:52.340 --> 00:07:53.740
Aye, aye-o!

00:08:04.660 --> 00:08:05.420
Die!

00:08:35.920 --> 00:08:38.080
Polnareff... Emerald Splash...

00:08:38.220 --> 00:08:39.350
...was shot at him!

00:08:42.960 --> 00:08:44.790
To save Polnareff's life!?

00:08:54.570 --> 00:08:56.700
It's out of my Stand's range...

00:08:57.370 --> 00:09:01.310
even if it hits the target, it's too
far away for maximum impact.

00:09:06.050 --> 00:09:10.650
I guess Mr. J. Gail is out to
get rid of Polnareff entirely.

00:09:14.590 --> 00:09:16.290
Sorry, Kakyoin...

00:09:17.660 --> 00:09:18.390
I...

00:09:19.230 --> 00:09:23.330
If I could have avenged my sister, I wouldn't
have minded being killed in the attempt...

00:09:23.470 --> 00:09:27.460
but now I understand
what Avdol meant to say...

00:09:28.640 --> 00:09:30.770
His thoughtfulness will not go to waste...

00:09:31.540 --> 00:09:33.200
I will fight to live.

00:09:37.450 --> 00:09:38.240
Polnareff...

00:09:38.980 --> 00:09:40.970
do you truly understand now?

00:09:41.320 --> 00:09:41.880
Yeah.

00:09:50.330 --> 00:09:53.460
That's in lieu of shaking hands to make up.

00:09:55.670 --> 00:09:56.500
Ah, yeah...

00:09:57.370 --> 00:09:59.930
Now they're not your enemy alone.

00:10:00.070 --> 00:10:03.040
Next time they attack us...

00:10:04.640 --> 00:10:06.700
you and I will defeat them together!

00:10:26.000 --> 00:10:29.560
That was close. I'm at a
disadvantage by myself.

00:10:30.470 --> 00:10:33.100
I'm the type of guy who won't act alone.

00:10:33.240 --> 00:10:35.430
Oh well, I should try again later.

00:10:37.240 --> 00:10:40.070
I'm sure I stabbed him with my sword...

00:10:42.480 --> 00:10:44.570
But, it didn't hit the target.

00:10:44.720 --> 00:10:46.310
I felt no resistance.

00:10:49.820 --> 00:10:51.290
His Stand...

00:10:51.660 --> 00:10:56.590
the Hanged Man, can launch an attack
from even the smallest fragment.

00:10:56.890 --> 00:11:00.060
The Hanged Man attacks my
reflection from inside the mirror.

00:11:00.630 --> 00:11:04.160
But... there's no way I can get
myself into something like a mirror!

00:11:05.100 --> 00:11:07.970
How am I supposed to fight
an opponent like him?

00:11:08.110 --> 00:11:08.590
Shit!

00:11:12.580 --> 00:11:13.600
Polnareff...

00:11:14.750 --> 00:11:18.940
You keep saying things like, "inside the
mirror," or "the world of the mirror..."

00:11:19.080 --> 00:11:22.210
but there's no such "world inside."

00:11:22.590 --> 00:11:23.880
What are you saying!?

00:11:24.220 --> 00:11:25.590
You saw it, too!

00:11:25.920 --> 00:11:28.950
He exists in the mirror, but if
you turn around, he's not there!

00:11:29.060 --> 00:11:34.020
Yes, but a mirror is just a
reflection of light... that's all.

00:11:34.160 --> 00:11:37.600
I don't need you to tell me...
Of course I know that!

00:11:37.900 --> 00:11:38.460
Listen...

00:11:38.870 --> 00:11:41.390
I'm not talking about
common knowledge here!

00:11:43.770 --> 00:11:46.040
If a Stand can exist...

00:11:46.180 --> 00:11:50.140
I'm telling you it's not so strange that
a "world inside the mirror" exists!

00:11:54.250 --> 00:11:55.150
What...?

00:11:55.950 --> 00:11:57.980
You still got a problem with that?

00:11:58.120 --> 00:11:58.780
No...

00:11:59.320 --> 00:12:03.090
But I do think the mystery to his
true nature is somehow related.

00:12:04.660 --> 00:12:05.420
And...

00:12:05.960 --> 00:12:09.190
That mystery must be his weakest point!

00:12:25.220 --> 00:12:25.910
Polnareff!

00:12:26.280 --> 00:12:27.610
He's in the plating on the steering wheel!

00:12:27.750 --> 00:12:28.150
What!?

00:12:31.790 --> 00:12:32.690
Damn it!

00:12:49.340 --> 00:12:51.140
Are you alright... Kakyoin?

00:12:52.440 --> 00:12:53.880
I hit my chest...

00:12:54.210 --> 00:12:55.340
but I'll manage.

00:12:55.680 --> 00:12:56.480
It's okay.

00:13:12.400 --> 00:13:13.190
Kakyoin!

00:13:13.330 --> 00:13:14.730
Get away from anything reflective!

00:13:18.000 --> 00:13:18.800
Now I understand!

00:13:18.940 --> 00:13:19.830
I just saw it!

00:13:21.270 --> 00:13:23.070
From mirror to mirror...

00:13:23.210 --> 00:13:25.330
he followed us here through
a series of reflections!

00:13:25.780 --> 00:13:26.440
Reflections?

00:13:26.880 --> 00:13:27.900
Which means he's...

00:13:28.710 --> 00:13:29.510
Light!

00:13:29.810 --> 00:13:32.840
Its true nature is... a Stand of light?

00:13:33.580 --> 00:13:35.810
Don't go near any reflective objects!

00:13:35.950 --> 00:13:38.180
Remove anything like
that from your body, too!

00:13:41.830 --> 00:13:42.760
My brothers...

00:13:42.890 --> 00:13:44.330
it seems you had a car accident?

00:13:44.460 --> 00:13:45.720
You must need medicine!

00:13:46.630 --> 00:13:49.160
Buy it from me...
I'll give it to you cheap!

00:13:53.400 --> 00:13:53.960
What?

00:13:54.200 --> 00:13:56.830
Please, buy it!
I'll give you a discount!

00:13:58.640 --> 00:13:59.700
B... bastard!

00:14:00.010 --> 00:14:01.200
In a child's eye...!

00:14:02.480 --> 00:14:03.570
Hey, kid!

00:14:03.710 --> 00:14:04.510
Don't look at us!

00:14:04.650 --> 00:14:05.340
But...

00:14:06.650 --> 00:14:07.550
We're fine!

00:14:07.850 --> 00:14:09.480
See! There's nothing wrong with us!

00:14:10.590 --> 00:14:12.420
Now go away, you little brat!

00:14:16.990 --> 00:14:18.330
You bastard...!

00:14:19.830 --> 00:14:20.420
Wait!

00:14:20.560 --> 00:14:21.190
Polnareff!

00:14:23.370 --> 00:14:24.600
What will you do now?

00:14:24.740 --> 00:14:29.870
You wouldn't poke this cute little child's
eyes out with your sword, would you?

00:14:35.780 --> 00:14:37.680
I've got you at last...

00:14:37.810 --> 00:14:39.370
you can't escape now...

00:14:39.520 --> 00:14:42.420
unless you poke out this child's eyes...

00:14:47.290 --> 00:14:49.320
Poke out the child's eyes, you say?

00:14:49.660 --> 00:14:50.350
Shit...

00:14:51.260 --> 00:14:53.060
Stabbing Avdol-san from behind...

00:14:53.200 --> 00:14:55.130
and now using a child...

00:14:55.270 --> 00:14:56.290
Unforgivable!

00:14:58.600 --> 00:15:00.040
Hey, Kakyoin!

00:15:00.170 --> 00:15:03.070
In this situation, you
don't utter lines like that.

00:15:03.470 --> 00:15:04.200
Listen...

00:15:04.340 --> 00:15:06.040
when the time comes
for you take revenge...

00:15:06.110 --> 00:15:08.580
the lines you need to deliver
go something like this!

00:15:10.510 --> 00:15:13.210
My name is Jean-Pierre Polnareff!

00:15:13.350 --> 00:15:15.840
For the honor of my sister's spirit!

00:15:15.990 --> 00:15:18.960
For my friend, Avdol, to rest in peace!

00:15:23.160 --> 00:15:25.960
I will drive you to the depths of despair!

00:15:31.640 --> 00:15:32.970
Forgive me, kid!

00:15:46.820 --> 00:15:48.340
In Polnareff's eyes...!

00:15:54.160 --> 00:15:56.130
I'm not sure how it works...

00:15:56.260 --> 00:15:58.230
but he moves at the speed of light.

00:15:58.360 --> 00:16:00.630
Normally, it's a speed
beyond all recognition.

00:16:01.000 --> 00:16:05.130
But if that kid's eyes were to close, I
knew his next move would be to my eyes.

00:16:05.900 --> 00:16:07.890
If you can predict that path...

00:16:08.440 --> 00:16:09.670
cutting him with my sword...

00:16:10.770 --> 00:16:11.640
is simple!

00:16:17.610 --> 00:16:18.380
Over there!

00:16:18.980 --> 00:16:19.970
Let's go, Kakyoin!

00:16:23.350 --> 00:16:24.620
Ah! The medicine...

00:16:32.900 --> 00:16:40.310
I will carry your bags! Cheap
fruit! Water! Do you need water?

00:16:54.450 --> 00:16:55.110
Bastard...

00:16:55.360 --> 00:16:56.010
Finally!

00:17:05.930 --> 00:17:07.730
At last we meet...

00:17:08.200 --> 00:17:09.400
J. Gail!

00:17:25.820 --> 00:17:28.690
I figured out your Stand's secret.

00:17:29.060 --> 00:17:32.650
Honestly, your Stand surprised me at first.

00:17:32.990 --> 00:17:36.430
Although it was clearly visible, there
was nothing I could do to counter it.

00:17:36.960 --> 00:17:39.760
But, once I understood its
true nature, it's no big deal.

00:17:39.900 --> 00:17:42.160
You can kiss your ass goodbye now.

00:17:44.040 --> 00:17:45.100
Now...

00:17:45.240 --> 00:17:47.570
let me finish you off slowly!

00:17:55.120 --> 00:17:56.670
T-this is...

00:17:58.320 --> 00:17:59.750
not J. Gail!

00:18:05.430 --> 00:18:06.410
Polnareff!

00:18:10.300 --> 00:18:11.260
Shit!

00:18:14.770 --> 00:18:17.530
You fool!

00:18:22.880 --> 00:18:23.810
J. Gail!

00:18:24.280 --> 00:18:26.970
You are a stupid fool after all...

00:18:27.110 --> 00:18:28.340
Polnareff!

00:18:29.280 --> 00:18:35.280
You didn't know my face, yet
you carelessly approached.

00:18:35.390 --> 00:18:38.150
That guy is just a street peddler...

00:18:38.290 --> 00:18:43.560
I simply cut him with a knife in the
same spot as The Hanged Man!

00:18:44.800 --> 00:18:45.230
Bastard!

00:18:45.230 --> 00:18:46.670
Uh-uh, hold it!

00:18:46.800 --> 00:18:48.960
Take a good look around.

00:18:49.100 --> 00:18:51.940
Hey, gather 'round!

00:18:52.070 --> 00:18:57.170
These travelers here would
like to give money to you all!

00:18:57.240 --> 00:18:59.710
(give money to you all!)

00:19:01.010 --> 00:19:01.450
Wha...

00:19:01.750 --> 00:19:02.810
What's going on?

00:19:07.390 --> 00:19:20.790
Oh, I'm grateful, please give it to me...
Give me money... I'm grateful, I'm grateful...

00:19:23.740 --> 00:19:26.470
Do you know what this means?

00:19:39.420 --> 00:19:42.010
You say you figured out my Stand?

00:19:42.160 --> 00:19:43.380
You fool!

00:19:43.520 --> 00:19:46.960
It's my Stand, so of course
I'm aware of its weakness!

00:19:47.090 --> 00:19:48.650
Increasing the number
of reflective objects...

00:19:48.730 --> 00:19:51.400
will make the motion path unpredictable,
and no longer will it be vulnerable!

00:19:51.400 --> 00:19:52.230
Don't look...!

00:19:52.370 --> 00:19:53.560
Everyone, stop looking at us!

00:19:57.170 --> 00:19:58.690
Now you can't escape...

00:19:58.770 --> 00:20:04.570
or do you want to create an exit by
slaughtering the innocent peddlers?

00:20:06.880 --> 00:20:08.140
Polnareff!

00:20:08.280 --> 00:20:11.880
You have sacrificed your
youth to pursue me...

00:20:11.950 --> 00:20:14.920
oh, with your resolution unfulfilled...

00:20:15.120 --> 00:20:18.560
What a wretched life it's been!

00:20:19.030 --> 00:20:20.930
But be assured!

00:20:21.060 --> 00:20:27.990
In this world without you, I will happily
live on, with women waiting upon me!

00:20:30.970 --> 00:20:32.060
Is it really us they want to see...?

00:20:32.340 --> 00:20:33.030
Or...?

00:20:33.440 --> 00:20:36.810
By the way, what a great
wailing performance she gave...

00:20:43.080 --> 00:20:44.980
your little sister...!

00:20:49.520 --> 00:20:50.680
Bastard!

00:20:50.820 --> 00:20:51.720
Just you wait!

00:20:51.860 --> 00:20:52.690
I'm coming up there right now...

00:20:56.660 --> 00:20:57.320
Polnareff...

00:20:58.060 --> 00:21:00.120
your words are not appropriate.

00:21:00.270 --> 00:21:02.100
When the time comes to take revenge...

00:21:02.240 --> 00:21:04.400
your shouldn't use words
like "bastard" in your lines.

00:21:04.540 --> 00:21:05.800
You say it like this...

00:21:07.040 --> 00:21:09.070
My name is KAKYOIN Noriaki!

00:21:09.640 --> 00:21:11.940
For my friend Avdol...

00:21:12.080 --> 00:21:16.450
and for the soul of my friend
Polnareff's sister to rest in peace!

00:21:19.190 --> 00:21:20.150
May J. Gail...

00:21:20.290 --> 00:21:22.020
attone for these crimes with his life!

00:21:25.160 --> 00:21:28.030
I will give that gold coin
to whoever picks it up!

00:21:33.470 --> 00:21:36.830
It's a gold coin so shiny
you can see your face in it!

00:21:38.310 --> 00:21:39.070
I see!

00:21:39.540 --> 00:21:40.870
I understand, Kakyoin!

00:21:45.610 --> 00:21:46.770
Right there!

00:21:53.720 --> 00:21:55.590
Chariot!

00:22:38.600 --> 00:22:42.130
S... spare me, Polnareff! I beg you!

00:22:42.740 --> 00:22:45.800
It's you who are good at wailing...

00:22:45.940 --> 00:22:47.000
J. Gail!

00:22:47.240 --> 00:22:50.180
I... I was wrong! I'll do
whatever you say, so...

00:22:50.310 --> 00:22:52.040
please forgive me!

00:22:52.510 --> 00:22:53.710
My little sister...

00:22:54.380 --> 00:22:57.410
My little sister must have
said the same thing to you.

00:22:58.820 --> 00:23:00.310
But you...

00:23:00.450 --> 00:23:04.620
You killed my sister to
satisfy your desires anyway!

00:23:05.230 --> 00:23:08.680
How long have I
waited for this moment...

00:23:10.900 --> 00:23:14.260
From here, you'll be wailing
your way down to hell...

00:23:14.330 --> 00:23:17.830
but there are things I can't
leave to the sentries of hell!

00:23:17.970 --> 00:23:20.530
DIE!

00:24:23.140 --> 00:24:24.160
As befits his name...

00:24:24.300 --> 00:24:27.360
he became a hanged man.

00:24:34.380 --> 00:24:36.010
I'm not up to this...

00:24:37.380 --> 00:24:39.510
I'm at a disadvantage by myself.

00:24:39.650 --> 00:24:41.780
Only by pairing up with someone...

00:24:41.860 --> 00:24:43.450
can my real abilities shine.

00:24:44.020 --> 00:24:45.750
Better to be number two
than number one...

00:24:45.890 --> 00:24:48.490
that's my philosophy of life!

00:24:48.630 --> 00:24:50.490
I should run and wait for
the next opportunity...

00:24:55.600 --> 00:24:56.160
Bastard!

00:25:08.550 --> 00:25:09.540
Jotaro!

00:25:09.680 --> 00:25:10.410
Joseph-san!

00:25:11.820 --> 00:25:13.680
We already know about Avdol...

00:25:14.450 --> 00:25:18.410
we gave him a simple but proper burial.

00:25:19.530 --> 00:25:20.490
So...

00:25:21.160 --> 00:25:23.130
What are we going to
do with this guy?

00:25:24.730 --> 00:25:28.530
The bastard who stabbed Abdul-san
in the back was J. Gail, but...

00:25:28.670 --> 00:25:31.930
the direct cause of death
was the bullet this guy fired.

00:25:33.610 --> 00:25:34.940
I see...

00:25:40.710 --> 00:25:42.580
It's settled, then.

00:25:44.120 --> 00:25:46.110
Let me be the one to carry out justice!

00:25:46.290 --> 00:25:46.980
H... hey!

00:25:47.120 --> 00:25:49.610
S... spare me! I'll do anything! OK? OK!?

00:25:50.490 --> 00:25:53.080
Every one of them...
begging for their lives...

00:25:53.760 --> 00:25:56.390
You can't get off that
easily in this world...

00:25:56.700 --> 00:25:58.360
I'll teach you that!

00:26:01.070 --> 00:26:03.000
Please run, my dearest Hol Horse...

00:26:03.140 --> 00:26:04.230
You...!

00:26:04.840 --> 00:26:07.330
I'm always concerned for your well-being!

00:26:07.470 --> 00:26:09.200
It's my reason for living!

00:26:09.340 --> 00:26:10.740
Please, hurry!

00:26:11.010 --> 00:26:12.240
What's...?
This woman...!

00:26:16.020 --> 00:26:17.480
Thanks for saying that!

00:26:17.620 --> 00:26:21.610
I gladly accept your offer,
and I shall live on!

00:26:21.890 --> 00:26:22.820
Bastard!

00:26:23.160 --> 00:26:24.210
Dearest Hol Horse!

00:26:24.920 --> 00:26:27.360
I'm running away because I love you...

00:26:27.490 --> 00:26:31.450
otherwise, we won't be able
to love each other forever.

00:26:31.830 --> 00:26:33.130
See ya, baby.

00:26:33.270 --> 00:26:34.460
Love you!

00:26:35.870 --> 00:26:36.800
Wait!

00:26:48.650 --> 00:26:49.410
Shit!

00:26:52.090 --> 00:26:53.250
This woman...!

00:26:53.320 --> 00:26:54.810
Stop, Polnareff!

00:26:55.090 --> 00:26:56.080
Why!?

00:26:56.220 --> 00:26:58.160
That bastard killed Avdol!

00:26:58.890 --> 00:27:01.420
Now is not the time to chase off after him.

00:27:01.560 --> 00:27:05.660
We don't have time for a side trip.

00:27:06.930 --> 00:27:07.830
That's right.

00:27:08.370 --> 00:27:11.060
To carry out Avdol-san's intentions...

00:27:11.370 --> 00:27:14.770
it's best that we hurry on ahead for now.

00:27:16.280 --> 00:27:17.400
Alright!

00:27:27.890 --> 00:27:28.910
Avdol...

00:27:31.290 --> 00:27:33.450
Please rest in peace...

00:27:33.590 --> 00:27:35.250
we'll join you soon.

00:27:38.530 --> 00:27:39.620
Well, everyone!

00:27:39.770 --> 00:27:42.000
Let's resume our journey to Egypt!

00:27:44.470 --> 00:27:45.440
Listen!

00:27:45.570 --> 00:27:46.900
Dio is a formidable enemy.

00:27:47.040 --> 00:27:50.570
To beat him, we must
join our hearts as one!

00:27:50.710 --> 00:27:54.580
If any one of us gets out of line,
he's sure to take advantage of it!

00:27:54.710 --> 00:27:55.610
Be careful!

00:27:58.850 --> 00:28:01.220
How can he say something like that to us?

00:28:01.350 --> 00:28:04.380
In his own way, he's
reflecting on what he's done...

00:28:04.520 --> 00:28:06.920
including the incident with Avdol.

00:28:10.600 --> 00:28:12.220
What a pain...

00:28:21.170 --> 00:28:22.770
Come on, move it!

00:28:23.240 --> 00:28:24.270
O... oh...

00:28:29.020 --> 00:28:30.040
<i>Avd</i>o<i>l</i>

00:28:30.880 --> 00:28:32.010
<i>just watch</i>

00:28:32.790 --> 00:28:35.280
<i>I pr</i>o<i>mise I'll avenge y</i>o<i>u! </i>

00:28:57.440 --> 00:28:58.030
Just now...!

00:28:59.250 --> 00:29:02.040
My son has died!

00:29:14.190 --> 00:29:18.460
My dearest son...!

00:29:18.600 --> 00:29:19.530
You perished...

00:29:19.600 --> 00:29:23.430
your body covered with wounds like this!

00:29:26.040 --> 00:29:27.940
Your agony...

00:29:28.070 --> 00:29:32.100
I can feel it through the
pain of these stigmata!

00:29:32.580 --> 00:29:34.640
Goddamn it...

00:29:34.780 --> 00:29:35.750
I'll fucking kill you all!

00:29:36.750 --> 00:29:40.120
I'll damn well make sure I kill
you all with my own hands...

00:29:42.190 --> 00:29:44.120
with my own Stand...

00:29:44.260 --> 00:29:46.190
Justice!
